{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1024_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1025_018ele", "source_sha256": "1d71ae0e88d554d4129e1d14f5c3fa55d6303b9e9b1290afcf99a01a8d4573d5", "ja": "ハーイ！　みんな、差し入れだヨー！　ママンが\nブリガデイロ作ったから持っていきなさいって！", "zh": "嗨——！大家，这是慰问品哟——！妈妈做了布里加德罗，让我带来给你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "5d319728a1c3f8e610fcf8f64f89fcee45884ca49e71ddfe9ceac2b64e6e948c", "ja": "まいど！　アメちゃんもあるで～。\nって、なんやお取り込み中でした？", "zh": "你好呀！还有糖果哦～。\n哎，怎么了，你们在忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "9d14d35adeb0f8f3f87491cfb5c09a6cf043633ced39bb55c362c57cfbac800d", "ja": "エレナ、奈緒？　いや……いいんだ。\nありがとう、いただくよ。", "zh": "艾琳娜、奈绪？不……没事。\n谢谢，我收下了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "89cc540bd9465885db159a7170a9d13abd2eaa064a2b33be10e7f09157d0c353", "ja": "よかった♪　じゃあワタシ達、レッスンだから行くネ！\nあと、大事に思ってくれてるのはうれしいケド～。", "zh": "太好了♪　那我们要去上课了哦！\n还有，你能这么为我们着想虽然很高兴啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1029_037nao", "source_sha256": "1f87ad511752816a677227c1745a35ff844acf075b2436b195407c0c37101337", "ja": "過保護にはせんといてくださいねー。私らも覚悟決めて\nトップアイドル目指してますんで！　ほな！", "zh": "别太过保护我们啦——我们也已经下定决心要成为顶尖偶像了！那先走啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1030_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "6554efe6c1ba4a5bdf9a1443a8e7a581a6e87362cbb8fd27446f312880e6eac7", "ja": "えっ？　あれっ？\nもしかして……聞かれてた？", "zh": "诶？咦？\n难道说……被听到了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1032_402cpr", "source_sha256": "0a2904ec116c9d786805ec198a0f53f4fc43f5146d85352b0816bac028f4a2e0", "ja": "……みたいだな。", "zh": "……看来是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
