{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1034_president", "source_sha256": "f4b3826d83cb8277c24e630c36299b66cfff5a461690ad716c43a4865e6c34c0", "ja": "我々の役目は、彼女達を決して……。\n一人にはしないことだ。", "zh": "我们的职责，就是绝不能……。\n让她们独自一人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_350_vd_10_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_350_vd_10_1035_president", "source_sha256": "9a24e6768771fb7c176d8be9c3486d1b37827b06d427d059998cc5c5a82d82bf", "ja": "と、私は思うがね！", "zh": "不过，我是这么认为的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
